# facebend, the caricature generator: it draws its guide face and asks for an image to bend; with no image it ends. The package stages
# no image beside it, so the script reaches the load dialog's own road: a name typed (the pointer inside the dialog) and Return, the
# notice Can't open nosuch.gif, its Okay, the dialog again, and Cancel, which ends the program by itself, rc 0. Left out: the point
# picking, the display menu and the distortion slider, which need a loaded image.
move 320 230
type nosuch.gif
wait
key Return
wait
click 1 320 261
wait
click 1 348 274
